<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on Cable and Wireless.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Cable and Wireless.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on shares of Cable and Wireless plc, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    5.45 STG		  ISSUE PRICE  1.02 STG</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   09.DEC.98		 PAYMENT DATE 01.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  5.45 STG</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
